<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Baker Hughes cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Baker Hughes cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Thursday analyst Paul Chambers downgraded Baker Hughes Inc to outperform from buy.</p>
<p>-- Cited shortfall in company's pre-tax income and lower than expected oilfield incremental margins.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 11/16 to 42-11/16.</p>
</text>
